# WHAT:      Arabic language variables of the kwtSMS add-on (add-on name, settings, privileges, menu).
# WHY:       CS-Cart installs them with the add-on and removes them on uninstall. Every key exists in
#            both language files (en and ar). Later tasks append their keys here.
# USAGE:     Read by CS-Cart on install and upgrade; edit values in Admin > Administration > Languages.
# DEPENDS:   Nothing.
